      // Scale is 1.8/1.61: character.glb is from the Blender FBX pipeline
      // (convert_fbx_to_glb.sh), which bakes the source .fbx's unit scale
      // directly into vertex data on import - mesh-local bounding box is
      // already ~1.61 units tall (meters), unlike the old assimp pipeline's
      // raw/un-unit-converted ~161 units. Scaled up to match the capsule
      // collider's 1.8 (length 1.0 + 2 * radius 0.4). Used to live as a
      // `CHARACTER_SCALE` Rust const; moved here once the only Rust code
      // that read it (a dead fallback spawn path) was deleted.
